OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the period with a band of
OL,7,Frain arriving through the evening and
OL,8,Fcrossing the region overnight,
OL,9,Fclearing to isolated showers by dawn.
OL,10,FBreezy initially but winds easing
OL,11,Fovernight. Feeling less mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA cloud but mostly dry
OL,14,Fmorning. Isolated showers developing
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon, these may turn
OL,16,Fheavy with the risk of hail and
OL,17,Fthunder. Light westerly winds
OL,18,Ffreshening through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
